{"availability":"available","full":"chandranshB/roleBase","name":"roleBase","description":"Free, open job search and job-market dataset: ~70k open jobs from employers' own career pages across healthcare, retail, finance, education, tech and more. Entry-level, remote and ghost-job filters.","category":"Finance","language":"HTML","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-04T08:23:56Z","updated":"2026-10-11T22:10:14Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://chandranshb.github.io/roleBase/","topics":["dataset","entry-level-jobs","github-actions","github-pages","job-board","job-listings","job-market","job-search","jobs","kaggle-dataset","labor-market","open-data","remote-jobs","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://chandranshb.github.io/roleBase/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:55.035Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:55.035Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:55.035Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:57.688Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:53.319Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:04:55.035Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["RoleBase is a free, open job board and job-market dataset that updates itself. It collects around 100,000 open jobs, 90,000 of them straight from about 1,000 employers' own career pages and the rest from open job feeds, in nursing, retail, finance, education, manufacturing, logistics, engineering and many other fields, and lets you filter for entry-level, remote and salary-listed roles. Postings are kept in git, tagged with level, field, skills and pay, and tracked until they disappear, so you can also see which listings look like ghost jobs. The result is published as a searchable website…"],"features":["One file per board, sorted and compact, so a change touches only the boards that changed.","Empty values are not stored. The apply link, level and field are rebuilt on load when they can be derived.","Descriptions a